    {
      "name": "p2",
      "aria": "The village",
      "segment": "s2",
      "z": 10,
      "top": "72%",
      "html": "      <h2>Closer, and it has rooftops.</h2>\n      <p>What read as a smudge on a ridge turns out to be a few hundred lives stacked up a slope.</p>"
    },
    {
      "name": "p3",
      "aria": "The lane",
      "segment": "s3",
      "z": 10,
      "top": "74%",
      "html": "      <h2>Closer, and it has a lane.</h2>\n      <p>Everything the village needs, arranged along one wet corridor barely wide enough for two people.</p>"
    },
    {
      "name": "p4",
      "aria": "The loom",
      "segment": "s4",
      "z": 10,
      "top": "22%",
      "html": "      <h2>Closer, and someone is working.</h2>\n      <p>A frame, a shuttle, and tension held by the weight of a body leaning back.</p>"
    },
    {
      "name": "p5",
      "aria": "The thread",
      "segment": "s5",
      "z": 10,
      "top": "26%",
      "html": "      <h2>And this is the whole of it.</h2>\n      <p>One strand crossing another, repeated until it becomes cloth, a trade, a hillside, a range you can see from the far side of a valley.</p>\n      <button class=\"note-button\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↑</span><span>Scroll back up</span></button>"
    }
